        }
      ]
    },
    "description": "Confirms the code and records the co-applicant's consent choices (evidence names the challenge and masked mobile). All required purposes granted → `granted`, otherwise `declined`. Borrower context for the applicant's own records; partner context for applications the firm filed (agents: the ones they filed). Others get 404.",
